%% O.B.R.A. Level 5 — current crater journey, layout v4 (5 November 2026).
%% No combat, health, refills or repeated quests from earlier levels.
flowchart TD
    START([Foot of Mayon: Lolo is waiting]) --> INK[Six ink; no refills]
    INK --> SPAN[Draw a way across]
    SPAN --> CLIMB[Draw a way up]
    CLIMB --> CP1(((Silent save at the crater)))
    CP1 --> CRATER[Active crater: jump into the opening]
    CRATER --> PAYYO

    subgraph JOURNEY[Twelve short playable places]
        direction TB
        PAYYO[Payyo: terraces → Ang Tulay → Ang Bale]
        PAYYO --> PIYESTA[Piyesta: dancing plaza → church → bandarita alley]
        PIYESTA --> DAGAT[Dagat: shore and bangka → coral and bakunawa → island]
        DAGAT --> DILIM[Dilim: forest → waterfall → dawn clearing]
    end

    JOURNEY -. each crossing .-> MASK[Foreground shadow masks the two places;<br/>moves at 2.2× camera travel; reverses on backtracking]
    JOURNEY -. nearby landmark .-> CHOICE{Spend ink to preserve it?}
    CHOICE -->|Yes| SAVE[Colour returns; her strokes remain]
    CHOICE -->|No| LOSS[Forward departure takes it to blank;<br/>backtracking does not reopen it]
    SAVE -. boat, church or terraces .-> STEADY[Lolo steadies; his farewell comes later]
    SAVE -. optional flower .-> FLOWER[Fifth flower; one Artist credit]
    DILIM --> FAREWELL[Lolo fades; the apo tries to draw him]
    STEADY -. cannot prevent his going .-> FAREWELL
    FAREWELL --> REFUSAL[The brush refuses; Lolo goes mid-sentence]
    REFUSAL --> WHITE[Final shadow reveals the white summit]
    WHITE --> CP2(((Silent save below the summit)))
    CP2 --> LOLA[Lola paints with her back turned]
    LOLA --> TRIES[The brush refuses her twice; the apo lowers it]
    TRIES --> PLACES[One free drawing blooms the saved places and her ink]
    PLACES --> TURN[Lola turns around]
    TURN --> FIVE{Five flowers?}
    FLOWER -. durable collectible .-> FIVE
    FIVE -->|Yes| KNOWN[For a moment she knows her; the moment passes]
    FIVE -->|No| WARM[Warm to a child she does not recognise]
    KNOWN --> HOME[Lolo. Let's go home.]
    WARM --> HOME
    HOME --> HOUSE[Lolo remains in the paintings;<br/>Lola asks the apo to watch her paint]
    HOUSE --> END([The house remains this way for the save])
